    (uuid "28d57839-7356-5f7a-9c9a-138cfa1573f6"))
  (text "C70/C71: place at VDD pin 8. C72: place at VDDIO pin 5. Both supplies remain on system +3V3.\nSPI2 mode 0, initial target 10MHz; CS setup/hold and MISO release guard >=100ns.\nR73 on sheet 09 holds CS high at boot. Internal clock; INT1 active-low open-drain with R127 pull-up.\nPin 7 must be grounded. Pins 2/3/10/11 are intentionally NC, as permitted by the datasheet."
    (at 20 159 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f7bb0fb1-d9b2-56a1-8b27-032df3165873"))
  (text "Pin 9 has a 10k pulldown to avoid shorting a configurable output; select FSYNC input and leave FSYNC disabled.\nWait >=1ms after valid power before register access; read WHO_AM_I=0x47 and configure interface/interrupts.\nKeep IMU in sleep for USB suspend. Prove shared-bus operation and vibration rejection under haptic load.\nPosition/orientation is provisional: keep away from flexing PCB edges, hot brake resistors and motor/coil vibration."
    (at 20 204 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1a89e2f8-c009-5314-8b91-dc6a70f6d4a7"))
  (embedded_fonts no))
